Package: clonaut
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-requests, python3-pyqt6, rclone
Suggests: python3-pyside6
Replaces: gui-rclone
Conflicts: gui-rclone
Provides: gui-rclone
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Homepage: https://github.com/gradia64/Clonaut
Description: desktop GUI for rclone with transfers and schedules
 Clonaut is a Qt desktop application that drives rclone through its REST
 API (rclone rcd): manage remotes with a dynamic form, copy/move/sync
 transfers with progress bars, honest dry runs, a safety trash for
 deleted or overwritten files, persistent scheduled transfers, per-job
 exclusions and a system tray icon.
 .
 rclone does all the file handling; Clonaut is just the interface.
 The user interface is currently in Italian.
